      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I am confident in my weapons, but if I am honest,\r\nthis time I may have made a mistake...\r\nIs this Infected Griffin as ferocious as they say?",
        "Jp" : "俺も腕には自信があるつもりだが、\r\n正直言って今回はヒヤリとさせられた――\r\n侵食されたグリフィンとは、これほど凶暴なものか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 486675,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "As one would expect, even though I was prepared\r\nto die,\r\nI still live, and I must not take that for\r\ngranted...",
        "Jp" : "さすがに今回ばかりは、落命すら覚悟した\r\nまだ命がある事、感謝せねば――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 486678,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Anyway, my collection has recently grown in\r\nsize...\r\nI've decided to keep it all in one place, as it\r\nis getting hard\r\nto carry it around everywhere with me.",
        "Jp" : "ともあれ、そろそろ収集物も増えてきた――\r\n持ち歩くにも動きづらいため\r\nひとまとまりにして保管しておくことにしよう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 486681,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
